        "official_en_sha256": "790796dd191fce21ff349c809c038252376116c9699437ccdd0243babcbca15c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いつもだったら\r\nセイレーンという幻獣の歌が聞こえてきて\r\n波をしずめてくれるんだが……。",
        "official_en": "Well, normally, Siren would sing to the waves. Brings ’em right down.",
        "real_en": "Normally, you can hear an Eidolon called Siren singing. Her song calms the waves, but..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
