        "official_en_sha256": "846ecd8552e64f8f3e04ba1b91acffc6764003e5148af47d3701e866fc3361fd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここからだと北東にある塔だ。\r\nみんな、セイレーンの塔って呼んでる。",
        "official_en": "She’ll be in the tower to the northeast. Call it Siren’s Tower, we do. Ten guesses as to why.",
        "real_en": "There's a tower to the northeast of here. Everyone calls it Siren's Tower."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
